# WC26 Project Rules

## Code
- TypeScript strict; no `any` unless unavoidable
- Tailwind for styling; early returns; `handle*` for event handlers
- Client components need `"use client"` when using hooks
- Prefer passing `Match[]` into pure lib functions over global static imports

## Next.js
- App Router in `src/app/`
- Route handlers in `src/app/api/`
- Read Next.js 16 docs in `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before API changes

## Data
- Team codes are 3-letter strings (`BRA`, `ARG`)
- Knockout match IDs: `r32-1` … `r32-16`, `r16-1` … `final`, `third-place`
- Bracket slots use `nextSlotId` for winner propagation

## Commits
- Format: `feat(scope): description` or `fix(scope): description`
